<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>You're invited to {{organization}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f3f4f6">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f3f4f6">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#111827">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px">
<img src="{{logoUrl}}" width="160" height="39" alt="ModularIoT" style="display:block;border:0">
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3">
You're invited to {{organization}}
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 32px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151">
{{inviter}} invited you to join <strong>{{organization}}</strong>. To accept, open the link and sign in with <strong>{{email}}</strong>.
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px">
<a href="{{link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;background:#072444;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px">Accept the invitation</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 32px 32px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280">
The invitation expires on {{expiresAt}}. If you did not expect this email, you can ignore it.<br>
If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<span style="word-break:break-all">{{link}}</span>
</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af">Sent with ModularIoT</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
